---
description: >-
  Classic-look sequence diagram where participants combine `type` and
  `alias` in the same inline `@{ "type": ..., "alias": ... }` metadata
  object (boundary, control, database), verifying that both fields are
  read from a single config object rather than needing the separate `as`
  keyword.
config:
  look: classic
  sequence:
    diagramMarginX: 50
    diagramMarginY: 10
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant API@{ "type" : "boundary", "alias": "Public API" }
  participant Auth@{ "type" : "control", "alias": "Auth Service" }
  participant DB@{ "type" : "database", "alias": "User DB" }
  API ->> Auth: Login request
  Auth ->> DB: Query user
  DB -->> Auth: User data
  Auth -->> API: Token
